<section xid="547" props="page-margin-footer:0.5in; page-margin-header:0.5in">
<p style="Normal" xid="548" props="text-align:center"><c props="text-decoration:underline; font-weight:bold; font-size:18pt; font-style:italic">Technical Requirements Document (TRD)</c></p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="1"><c>1. Purpose</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="2"><c>This document says </c><c props="font-weight:bold">what the program must do technically</c><c>, in simple words. Each item can be tested. It follows from the user needs in Document 1.</c></p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="3"><c>2. Environment</c></p>
<table xid="4">
<cell xid="5" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:0">
<p xid="6"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="7"><c>Item</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="9" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:0">
<p xid="10"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="11"><c>Requirement</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="13" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:1">
<p xid="14"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="15"><c>Operating system</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="17" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:1">
<p xid="18"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="19"><c>Linux</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="21" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:2">
<p xid="22"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="23"><c>Language</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="25" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:2">
<p xid="26"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="27"><c>C, standard gnu11</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="29" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:3">
<p xid="30"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="31"><c>Compiler</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="33" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:3">
<p xid="34"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="35"><c>gcc</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="37" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:4">
<p xid="38"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="39"><c>Libraries</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="41" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:4">
<p xid="42"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="43"><c>pthread, real-time library (for shared memory)</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="45" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:5">
<p xid="46"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="47"><c>Build tool</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="49" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:5">
<p xid="50"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="51"><c>make</c></p>
</cell>
</table>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="54"><c>3. Functional requirements</c></p>
<table xid="55">
<cell xid="56" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:0">
<p xid="57"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="58"><c>ID</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="60" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:0">
<p xid="61"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="62"><c>Requirement</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="64" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:0">
<p xid="65"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="66"><c>Linked user need</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="68" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:1">
<p xid="69"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="70"><c>TR-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="72" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:1">
<p xid="73"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="74"><c>The parent process creates the database file fresh at every start</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="76" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:1">
<p xid="77"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="78"><c>UR-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="80" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:2">
<p xid="81"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="82"><c>TR-02</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="84" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:2">
<p xid="85"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="86"><c>The parent creates a shared memory area and puts the ticket counters in it</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="88" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:2">
<p xid="89"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="90"><c>UR-02, UR-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="92" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:3">
<p xid="93"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="94"><c>TR-03</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="96" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:3">
<p xid="97"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="98"><c>The parent starts the set number of worker processes using fork</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="100" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:3">
<p xid="101"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="102"><c>UR-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="104" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:4">
<p xid="105"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="106"><c>TR-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="108" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:4">
<p xid="109"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="110"><c>Each worker starts a fixed number of threads (a thread pool)</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="112" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:4">
<p xid="113"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="114"><c>UR-03</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="116" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:5">
<p xid="117"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="118"><c>TR-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="120" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:5">
<p xid="121"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="122"><c>Each worker has a list of jobs, and each job writes one record to the database</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="124" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:5">
<p xid="125"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="126"><c>UR-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="128" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:6">
<p xid="129"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="130"><c>TR-06</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="132" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:6">
<p xid="133"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="134"><c>Before using the database, a process takes a ticket and waits until its number is called</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="136" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:6">
<p xid="137"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="138"><c>UR-02, UR-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="140" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:7">
<p xid="141"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="142"><c>TR-07</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="144" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:7">
<p xid="145"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="146"><c>After its turn starts, the process also takes an operating system file lock</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="148" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:7">
<p xid="149"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="150"><c>UR-02, UR-06</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="152" props="bot-attach:9; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:8">
<p xid="153"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="154"><c>TR-08</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="156" props="bot-attach:9; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:8">
<p xid="157"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="158"><c>Inside a process, a mutex lets only one thread work with the database or the job counter at a time</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="160" props="bot-attach:9; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:8">
<p xid="161"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="162"><c>UR-03, UR-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="164" props="bot-attach:10; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:9">
<p xid="165"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="166"><c>TR-09</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="168" props="bot-attach:10; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:9">
<p xid="169"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="170"><c>A process writes at most the batch size (50) records in one turn, then releases the lock and calls the next ticket</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="172" props="bot-attach:10; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:9">
<p xid="173"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="174"><c>UR-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="176" props="bot-attach:11; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:10">
<p xid="177"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="178"><c>TR-10</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="180" props="bot-attach:11; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:10">
<p xid="181"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="182"><c>The process also releases its turn when it has no jobs left</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="184" props="bot-attach:11; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:10">
<p xid="185"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="186"><c>UR-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="188" props="bot-attach:12; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:11">
<p xid="189"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="190"><c>TR-11</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="192" props="bot-attach:12; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:11">
<p xid="193"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="194"><c>Each record is written with one write call to a file opened in append mode</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="196" props="bot-attach:12; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:11">
<p xid="197"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="198"><c>UR-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="200" props="bot-attach:13; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:12">
<p xid="201"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="202"><c>TR-12</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="204" props="bot-attach:13; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:12">
<p xid="205"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="206"><c>The data is flushed to disk (fsync) when a turn ends</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="208" props="bot-attach:13; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:12">
<p xid="209"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="210"><c>UR-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="212" props="bot-attach:14; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:13">
<p xid="213"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="214"><c>TR-13</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="216" props="bot-attach:14; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:13">
<p xid="217"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="218"><c>The parent waits for all workers and counts how many failed</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="220" props="bot-attach:14; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:13">
<p xid="221"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="222"><c>UR-08</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="224" props="bot-attach:15; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:14">
<p xid="225"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="226"><c>TR-14</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="228" props="bot-attach:15; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:14">
<p xid="229"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="230"><c>The parent counts the lines in the database and compares with the expected number</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="232" props="bot-attach:15; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:14">
<p xid="233"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="234"><c>UR-08</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="236" props="bot-attach:16; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:15">
<p xid="237"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="238"><c>TR-15</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="240" props="bot-attach:16; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:15">
<p xid="241"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="242"><c>The program exits with success only if no worker failed and the counts match</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="244" props="bot-attach:16; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:15">
<p xid="245"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="246"><c>UR-08</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="248" props="bot-attach:17; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:16">
<p xid="249"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="250"><c>TR-16</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="252" props="bot-attach:17; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:16">
<p xid="253"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="254"><c>The shared memory area is removed at the end</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="256" props="bot-attach:17; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:16">
<p xid="257"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="258"><c>UR-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="260" props="bot-attach:18; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:17">
<p xid="261"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="262"><c>TR-17</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="264" props="bot-attach:18; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:17">
<p xid="265"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="266"><c>The parent handles the interrupt and terminate signals and stops the workers</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="268" props="bot-attach:18; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:17">
<p xid="269"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="270"><c>UR-06</c></p>
</cell>
</table>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="273"><c>4. Configuration requirements</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="546"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="274"><c>All settings are constants in one header file, so changing them needs only a rebuild.</c></p>
<table xid="275">
<cell xid="276" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:0">
<p xid="277"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="278"><c>Setting</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="280" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:0">
<p xid="281"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="282"><c>Default</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="284" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:0">
<p xid="285"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="286"><c>Meaning</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="288" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:1">
<p xid="289"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="290"><c>NUM_PROCESSES</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="292" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:1">
<p xid="293"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="294"><c>4</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="296" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:1">
<p xid="297"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="298"><c>Number of worker processes</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="300" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:2">
<p xid="301"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="302"><c>THREADS_PER_PROC</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="304" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:2">
<p xid="305"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="306"><c>8</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="308" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:2">
<p xid="309"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="310"><c>Threads in each process</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="312" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:3">
<p xid="313"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="314"><c>JOBS_PER_PROC</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="316" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:3">
<p xid="317"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="318"><c>2000</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="320" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:3">
<p xid="321"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="322"><c>Records each process must store</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="324" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:4">
<p xid="325"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="326"><c>BATCH_SIZE</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="328" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:4">
<p xid="329"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="330"><c>50</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="332" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:4">
<p xid="333"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="334"><c>Records a process may write in one turn</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="336" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:5">
<p xid="337"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="338"><c>DB_FILE</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="340" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:5">
<p xid="341"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="342"><c>db.dat</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="344" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:5">
<p xid="345"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="346"><c>Database file name</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="348" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:6">
<p xid="349"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="350"><c>SHM_NAME</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="352" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:6">
<p xid="353"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="354"><c>/fair_db_shm</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="356" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:6">
<p xid="357"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="358"><c>Shared memory name</c></p>
</cell>
</table>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="361"><c>5. Non-functional requirements</c></p>
<table xid="362">
<cell xid="363" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:0">
<p xid="364"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="365"><c>ID</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="367" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:0">
<p xid="368"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="369"><c>Requirement</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="371" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:1">
<p xid="372"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="373"><c>NF-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="375" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:1">
<p xid="376"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="377"><c>Correctness. Found records must equal expected records for any valid setting</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="379" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:2">
<p xid="380"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="381"><c>NF-02</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="383" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:2">
<p xid="384"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="385"><c>Fairness. Turns are given in the order of arrival (first come, first served)</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="387" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:3">
<p xid="388"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="389"><c>NF-03</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="391" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:3">
<p xid="392"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="393"><c>Safety. No thread data race, as checked by the thread checker</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="395" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:4">
<p xid="396"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="397"><c>NF-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="399" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:4">
<p xid="400"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="401"><c>Error handling. Every system call that can fail (open, write, fork, mmap, fcntl, pthread_create) is checked, and a failure is reported</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="403" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:5">
<p xid="404"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="405"><c>NF-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="407" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:5">
<p xid="408"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="409"><c>Memory. The program uses no dynamic memory allocation, so memory leaks are not possible</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="411" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:6">
<p xid="412"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="413"><c>NF-06</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="415" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:6">
<p xid="416"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="417"><c>Resources. The number of threads is fixed, so memory use for stacks stays small</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="419" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:7">
<p xid="420"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="421"><c>NF-07</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="423" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:7">
<p xid="424"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="425"><c>Build quality. The code compiles with no warnings under the strict warning flags</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="427" props="bot-attach:9; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:8">
<p xid="428"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="429"><c>NF-08</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="431" props="bot-attach:9; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:8">
<p xid="432"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="433"><c>Structure. Code is split into a header, a main file and a worker file, with a Makefile and README</c></p>
</cell>
</table>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="436"><c>6. Test requirements</c></p>
<table xid="437">
<cell xid="438" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:0">
<p xid="439"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="440"><c>ID</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="442" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:0">
<p xid="443"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="444"><c>Test</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="446" props="bot-attach:1; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:0">
<p xid="447"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="448"><c>Expected result</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="450" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:1">
<p xid="451"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="452"><c>T-01</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="454" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:1">
<p xid="455"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="456"><c>Build with make</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="458" props="bot-attach:2; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:1">
<p xid="459"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="460"><c>No errors, no warnings</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="462" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:2">
<p xid="463"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="464"><c>T-02</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="466" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:2">
<p xid="467"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="468"><c>Run the program</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="470" props="bot-attach:3; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:2">
<p xid="471"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="472"><c>Expected equals found (8000), zero failed workers</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="474" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:3">
<p xid="475"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="476"><c>T-03</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="478" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:3">
<p xid="479"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="480"><c>Build with the thread checker and run</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="482" props="bot-attach:4; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:3">
<p xid="483"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="484"><c>Same result, no race warning</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="486" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:4">
<p xid="487"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="488"><c>T-04</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="490" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:4">
<p xid="491"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="492"><c>Look at the first 120 lines of the database, grouped by process</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="494" props="bot-attach:5; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:4">
<p xid="495"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="496"><c>Groups of at most 50, alternating between processes</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="498" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:5">
<p xid="499"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="500"><c>T-05</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="502" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:5">
<p xid="503"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="504"><c>Change the number of processes to 8 and run</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="506" props="bot-attach:6; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:5">
<p xid="507"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="508"><c>Expected and found both 16000</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="510" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:6">
<p xid="511"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="512"><c>T-06</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="514" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:6">
<p xid="515"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="516"><c>Change the batch size to 10 and run</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="518" props="bot-attach:7; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:6">
<p xid="519"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="520"><c>Shorter groups, still all records present</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="522" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:0; right-attach:1; top-attach:7">
<p xid="523"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="524"><c>T-07</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="526" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:1; right-attach:2; top-attach:7">
<p xid="527"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="528"><c>Run with a memory checker (optional)</c></p>
</cell>
<cell xid="530" props="bot-attach:8; left-attach:2; right-attach:3; top-attach:7">
<p xid="531"></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="532"><c>No leaks, no errors</c></p>
</cell>
</table>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="535"><c>7. Known limits</c></p>
<p level="1" listid="1" parentid="0" style="Normal" xid="536" props="start-value:0; text-indent:-0.3in; list-style:Bullet List; field-font:NULL; margin-left:0.50in"><c></c><field type="list_label" xid="537"></field><c type="list_label">	If a process dies while it holds a ticket turn, the later tickets wait. A real product would add a timeout.</c></p>
<p level="1" listid="1" parentid="0" style="Normal" xid="538" props="start-value:0; text-indent:-0.3in; list-style:Bullet List; field-font:NULL; margin-left:0.50in"><c type="list_label"></c><field type="list_label" xid="539"></field><c>	The ticket wait uses a loop that yields the processor, which uses some CPU while waiting.</c></p>
<p level="1" listid="1" parentid="0" style="Normal" xid="540" props="start-value:0; text-indent:-0.3in; list-style:Bullet List; field-font:NULL; margin-left:0.50in"><c></c><field type="list_label" xid="541"></field><c>	Only writes are supported. There is no read path.</c></p>
<p level="1" listid="1" parentid="0" style="Normal" xid="542" props="start-value:0; text-indent:-0.3in; list-style:Bullet List; field-font:NULL; margin-left:0.50in"><c type="list_label" props="list-tag:1000"></c></p>
</section>
</abiword>
